---
// NovaStack Hero Section: International B2B Technology Studio
---

<section id="hero" class="relative pt-12 sm:pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-16 sm:pb-20 md:pb-28 bg-[#FAFAFA] border-b border-slate-200/80 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle Architectural Grid Background -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#E2E8F0_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#E2E8F0_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] opacity-40"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Top Studio Eyebrow Pill -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-xs mb-6 sm:mb-8">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-slate-700 tracking-wider uppercase">
          AI &amp; DIGITAL TECHNOLOGY STUDIO
        </span>
        <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 hidden sm:inline">
          USA · UK · UAE · AUS · IND
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Headline & Narrative Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Bold Value Proposition -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
        <h1 class="font-grotesk font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-[-0.035em] text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[4.25rem] leading-[1.04]">
          We Build Digital Products That Move Businesses <span class="text-[#0284C7] underline decoration-slate-200 underline-offset-8">Forward.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-sans max-w-3xl">
          NovaStack partners with founders, growing companies, and enterprise teams to engineer high-performance web applications, mobile platforms, and production AI automation workflows. From initial architectural discovery to scalable global deployment.
        </p>

        <!-- CTAs & Direct Engagement Action -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white font-grotesk font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm hover:shadow transition-all active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            <span>Start a Project</span>
            <span class="text-[#38BDF8] text-base leading-none">→</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="#work"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-grotesk font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider border border-slate-200 shadow-xs hover:border-slate-300 transition-all active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            <span>Explore Our Work</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400">↓</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tagline & Core Philosophy -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
          <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700">Philosophy:</span>
          <span>We Build.</span>
          <span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
          <span>Automate.</span>
          <span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
          <span>Optimize.</span>
          <span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
          <span>Scale.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Verification & Proof Points -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xs space-y-6">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 font-semibold block mb-1">
            Studio Practice
          </span>
          <h3 class="font-grotesk font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            Direct Founder Collaboration
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Every engagement is led by senior engineering leadership. Zero junior handoffs, transparent milestone tracking, and direct Slack/Teams integration.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
          <div>
            <span class="block text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">4+ Yrs</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Commercial Experience</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">&lt;24h</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Initial Scoping SLA</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">100%</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Codebase Ownership</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">5</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">Global Target Markets</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-600">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
            Accepting Q1/Q2 Projects
          </span>
          <a href="#contact" class="text-[#0284C7] font-semibold hover:underline">
            Inquire →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Premium B2B SaaS Interface Showcase (Software Dashboard & AI Workflows) -->
    <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-2 sm:p-3 shadow-md">
      <!-- Window Chrome -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-100 mb-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-200"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-200"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-200"></span>
          <span class="ml-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:inline">
            https://app.novastack.studio/orchestration/metrics
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          SYS: HEALTHY · ALL ENGINES OPERATIONAL
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Dashboard Mockup Body -->
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-slate-200/60 p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8">
        
        <!-- Metrics Header -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mb-1">
              <span>API RESPONSE LATENCY</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold font-mono">P99</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">38 ms</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-1">Edge Cached via Cloudflare</div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mb-1">
              <span>MULTI-LLM ROUTING</span>
              <span class="text-[#0284C7] font-semibold font-mono">ACTIVE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">4 Providers</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-1">OpenAI · Claude · Gemini · Perplexity</div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mb-1">
              <span>REAL-TIME EVENTS</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold font-mono">SYNC</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">&lt; 15 ms</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-1">WebSockets &amp; Redis Pub/Sub</div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 shadow-2xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 mb-1">
              <span>PRODUCTION UPTIME</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold font-mono">SLA</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold font-grotesk text-slate-900 tabular-nums">99.98%</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-1">Automated CI/CD &amp; Zero Downtime</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Lower Split: Live Telemetry Stream & System Architecture View -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5">
          <!-- Architecture Flow -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-2xs">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700">
                [ PRODUCTION PIPELINE ARCHITECTURE ]
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500">TYPESCRIPT END-TO-END</span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0284C7]"></span>
                  <span class="text-slate-800 font-medium">01. Web &amp; Mobile Client</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-slate-500">Next.js 15 / React Native</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-700"></span>
                  <span class="text-slate-800 font-medium">02. Edge Gateway &amp; Auth</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-slate-500">JWT / RBAC / Rate Limiting</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#0284C7]"></span>
                  <span class="text-slate-800 font-medium">03. AI Orchestration Engine</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-slate-500">Structured Outputs &amp; RAG</span>
              </div>

              <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span>
                  <span class="text-slate-800 font-medium">04. Relational &amp; Vector Data</span>
                </div>
                <span class="text-slate-500">PostgreSQL / Prisma / Pinecone</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Live Event Feed Preview -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700">
                  [ LIVE ORCHESTRATION LOG ]
                </span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-mono text-emerald-600 font-semibold">
                  <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></span>
                  STREAMING
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-600">
                <div class="p-2 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[#0284C7] font-semibold">200 OK</span>
                  <span class="text-slate-700">/api/v1/generate-survey [Claude 3.5 Sonnet]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="p-2 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-emerald-600 font-semibold">SYNC</span>
                  <span class="text-slate-700">Socket.IO room `crm_tickets_sla` updated</span>
                </div>
                <div class="p-2 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-[#0284C7] font-semibold">CACHE</span>
                  <span class="text-slate-700">Static route revalidation in 14ms</span>
                </div>
                <div class="p-2 rounded bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-slate-500 font-semibold">AUTH</span>
                  <span class="text-slate-700">Multi-tenant session validated: UAE cluster</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="pt-4 mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500">
              <span>NovaStack Telemetry Core</span>
              <span class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">Verified Architecture</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

